  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As per the given circuit, the value of current through the battery will be _____ A.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0087_158a80bc9f9d.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0087_158a80bc9f9d.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>In the given circuit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be reverse biased and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;forward biased. Therefore,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0087_eb9c1089b28c.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 126px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>"
  }
